mlxflow 0.8
1. Read Images         shoot/
2. <each judge_one; on_error=skip>   [image] -> [text]
     1. Describe Image   (input:1)   LFM2-VL 1.6B; "Blur, exposure problems,
                                     closed eyes? Be specific."
     2. Classify                     Ministral 3B; "Keeper? tags: keep, reject"
        -> { keep: 3 | reject: 4 }

     3. Template         (1)         "KEEP    {1}"
        -> 5

     4. Template         (1)         "REJECT  {1}"
     5. Template                     "{1}"
3. Join Text           separator="\n"
4. Save Text           cull-list.txt

5. Filter        (2)   contains="REJECT"
6. Count               items
7. Template            "{1} photos flagged — see cull-list.txt"
8. Save Text           cull-summary.txt
